- LiteRT-LM (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM
  Used through the com.google.ai.edge.litertlm Maven artifact.

- sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
